WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.984 --> 00:00:17.836
The king and queen stared at the stone statue in horror.

2
00:00:17.856 --> 00:00:20.519
"That's not our son!"

3
00:00:20.939 --> 00:00:21.660
the king said.

4
00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:25.583
"My baby has been kidnapped!"

5
00:00:26.163 --> 00:00:27.164
the queen cried.

6
00:00:27.184 --> 00:00:31.608
"And the villains left a statue in his place."

7
00:00:33.472 --> 00:00:34.873
"This is Nana's fault!"

8
00:00:35.193 --> 00:00:36.253
the king growled.

9
00:00:36.273 --> 00:00:40.515
"Guards! Find her, then throw her in the dungeon!"

10
00:00:43.077 --> 00:00:45.538
But, reader, the guards could not find Nana.

11
00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:52.961
And the prince's parents couldn't bear to look at the statue.

12
00:00:54.802 --> 00:00:57.864
So, they sent it to a town far from the castle.

13
00:01:01.740 --> 00:01:05.141
The townspeople were happy to have such a beautiful statue.

14
00:01:07.362 --> 00:01:10.844
It was made of stone but covered in gleaming gold.

15
00:01:13.845 --> 00:01:16.526
Three sparkling jewels sat in its belt.

16
00:01:19.447 --> 00:01:22.909
Often the people gathered at the statue's base, talking about it.

17
00:01:22.929 --> 00:01:27.251
"We're so lucky to have this statue!"

18
00:01:27.271 --> 00:01:29.912
"Look at his smile!"

19
00:01:34.776 --> 00:01:36.998
"Let's call him the Happy Prince!"

20
00:01:40.039 --> 00:01:42.801
One day a flock of swallows flew over the town.

21
00:01:46.864 --> 00:01:50.105
looks like a nice place," their leader said.

22
00:01:50.125 --> 00:01:54.308
"We'll spend the rest of the summer here.

23
00:01:57.230 --> 00:02:00.532
Then we'll fly to Egypt for the winter."

24
00:02:03.712 --> 00:02:05.713
And that's exactly what the swallows did.

25
00:02:07.274 --> 00:02:08.575
Most of them stayed in town.

26
00:02:10.316 --> 00:02:13.478
But one swallow liked to spend his time at the lake.

27
00:02:19.261 --> 00:02:21.803
One day the leader flew to talk to him.

28
00:02:21.823 --> 00:02:27.406
"Please join the rest of the flock," Leader said.

29
00:02:27.426 --> 00:02:30.788
"Summer is almost over.

30
00:02:31.964 --> 00:02:34.346
We will leave for Egypt soon."

31
00:02:34.366 --> 00:02:39.590
"I'm not going to Egypt," Swallow said.

32
00:02:39.610 --> 00:02:43.073
"Because I am in love!"

33
00:02:43.093 --> 00:02:49.518
"Ugh, not again," Leader thought.

34
00:02:50.759 --> 00:02:52.281
But he smiled politely.

35
00:02:52.301 --> 00:02:54.462
"With who?"

36
00:02:54.963 --> 00:02:55.503
he asked.

37
00:02:57.585 --> 00:03:00.067
"Come! I'll introduce you to my love!"

38
00:03:00.527 --> 00:03:01.228
Swallow said.

39
00:03:03.532 --> 00:03:05.713
He led Leader out over the water.

40
00:03:07.274 --> 00:03:11.757
As they flew, Swallow said, "She is the most beautiful thing in the world!"

41
00:03:13.918 --> 00:03:17.380
Now, every bird knew that Swallow loved beautiful things.

42
00:03:18.921 --> 00:03:21.042
He fell in love every season.

43
00:03:25.185 --> 00:03:25.805
Leader thought.

44
00:03:25.825 --> 00:03:30.028
"Is he talking about the lake this time?

45
00:03:33.172 --> 00:03:34.132
The sunset?

46
00:03:35.273 --> 00:03:36.634
Another bird maybe?"

47
00:03:38.694 --> 00:03:42.016
That's when Swallow landed lightly on a tall reed.

48
00:03:43.757 --> 00:03:44.737
Leader gasped.

49
00:03:45.958 --> 00:03:47.658
"Your love is a reed?"

50
00:03:47.678 --> 00:03:51.860
"Yes." Swallow smiled.

51
00:03:51.880 --> 00:03:54.241
"Isn't she beautiful?"

52
00:03:56.622 --> 00:03:58.043
Leader didn't want to be rude.

53
00:03:59.243 --> 00:04:00.804
And, reader, neither do I!

54
00:04:02.508 --> 00:04:05.869
Don't get me wrong—she was a lovely reed.

55
00:04:07.430 --> 00:04:08.671
She swayed in the breeze.

56
00:04:09.971 --> 00:04:12.812
She held Swallow gently when he landed on her.

57
00:04:14.673 --> 00:04:16.414
But she was still a reed!

58
00:04:18.134 --> 00:04:19.515
Leader blinked a few times.

59
00:04:19.535 --> 00:04:22.876
"I hope you change your mind.

60
00:04:24.817 --> 00:04:25.998
Winter is coming.

61
00:04:27.058 --> 00:04:29.199
It will get very cold here."

62
00:04:30.679 --> 00:04:31.800
Swallow didn't reply.

63
00:04:33.172 --> 00:04:37.259
He just smiled and stared at his beloved reed.
